OL,3,GNEWSA'Pepper spray', arrests and
OL,4,Arole-play shaping police of the future
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers rush to separate three
OL,7,Fpeople involved in a heated argument
OL,8,Fthat is threatening to spill over into
OL,9,Fviolence. A man, who is the main
OL,10,Faggressor and shouting foul language,
OL,11,Fis pepper-sprayed and handcuffed by an
OL,12,Fofficer as they bring the incident
OL,13,Funder control.
OL,15,FOn this occasion, it is all part of the
OL,16,Ftraining for some of the student
OL,17,Fofficers hoping to make the grade at
OL,18,FLincolnshire Police.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
