OL,3,GNEWSA'Pepper spray', arrests and
OL,4,Arole-play shaping police of the future
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe people involved are actors and the
OL,7,Fspray is water, but it is an example of
OL,8,Fwhat trainees will be dealing with
OL,9,Fshould they complete their two-year
OL,10,Ftraining course at the Nettleham HQ.
OL,12,FTwo of the hopefuls dealing with the
OL,13,Fpublic order incident, one of four
OL,14,Frole-play scenarios on the day, are
OL,15,FKieran Skinner and Chloe Hallberg.
